    \"m_Type\": \"UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData\",\n    \"m_ObjectId\":
    \"a063dcebe08a4424805cee6375f4b7d9\",\n    \"m_Title\": \"Fog\",\n    \"m_Content\":
    \"Using the current Scene's Fog and the Y axis(G) to interpolate the Scene's
    Fog color onto the skybox.\\n\\nWe can then lower the Height or Power of the
    Fog using the U axis (Vector 2's Y), giving the parameters full control over
    the fog height and strength.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\": 0,\n    \"m_Theme\": 1,\n   
    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\n        \"x\": -1086.4000244140625,\n       
    \"y\": 2175.199951171875,\n        \"width\": 374.4000244140625,\n        \"height\":
