    \"UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData\",\n    \"m_ObjectId\": \"e4a34b249a4d4133b402469deec963a7\",\n   
    \"m_Title\": \"Voronoi Stars\",\n    \"m_Content\": \"We can create lots of little
    dots by projecting a Voronoi noise over the sky, then Saturating it and inverting
    it with One Minus.\\n\\nAt the end we'll multiply with a HDR Color to change
    the color and luminosity of the stars.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\": 0,\n    \"m_Theme\":
    1,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\n        \"x\":
    -1544.0,\n        \"y\": 946.4000244140625,\n        \"width\": 171.199951171875,\n       
    \"height\": 174.4000244140625\n    },\n    \"m_Group\": {\n        \"m_Id\":
    \"\"\n    }\n}\n\n{\n    \"m_SGVersion\": 0,\n    \"m_Type\": \"UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.DynamicVectorMaterialSlot\",\n   
